<title>USA: Chrysler unit gets $228.3 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Chrysler unit gets $228.3 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electrospace Systems Inc of Richardson, Texas, a division of Chrysler Corp, has received a $228.3 million U.S. defense contract to provide logistics support for secure command and control communications for the Defense Department, the White House, NATO and other agencies, the Air Force said.</p>
</text>
